p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "track daily habits from the terminal => concept habit.purpose \"tracking daily habits from the terminal\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "the first argument names the habit to print => fact cli.habit \"the first argument names the habit\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p3 meta lang.pattern.p3 stated "read the habit log from the file named as the second argument, or from standard input when no file is named => fact input.source \"file argument or standard input\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p4 meta lang.pattern.p4 stated "each log line holds an iso date and a habit name separated by a tab => fact log.format \"date tab habit\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p5 meta lang.pattern.p5 stated "print one character per day from the log's earliest date to its latest date => fact render.span \"earliest to latest, one character per day\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p6 meta lang.pattern.p6 stated "mark a day the named habit was logged with <mark> => fact mark.logged \"<mark>\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p7 meta lang.pattern.p7 stated "mark a day it was not logged with <mark> => fact mark.missing \"<mark>\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p8 meta lang.pattern.p8 stated "install the tool as the command <cmd> => fact install.command \"<cmd>\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p9 meta lang.pattern.p9 stated "given the log of <e.list:,|and> the habit <q> prints <out> => fact witness.<q>.expected \"<out>\" ; concept witness.<q>.item.<e:index> \"<e>\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
p10 meta lang.pattern.p10.each.p9.e stated "<d> for <h> => fact witness.<q>.entry.<n:index> \"<d> <h>\"" @gen:de9bf00f29f8f957
